Upstream's files
----------------

lukewilliamboswell/weaver ships no LICENSE file at tag 0.9.0, and neither does
the repository it forks, smores56/weaver. These files are published in the
expectation that upstream adopts UPL-1.0, the license of the rest of the Roc
ecosystem. If you are one of weaver's authors and want them removed, open an
issue at https://github.com/Karakatiza666/roc-syntax-mcp/issues.


